---
import { cta } from '../../lib/site';
---

<section class="container-page pt-14 pb-section-tight lg:pt-24">
	<p class="anim-enter eyebrow">For independent caterers and small kitchen teams</p>
	<div class="mt-5 grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[7fr_5fr] lg:gap-16">
		<div>
			<h1 class="anim-enter max-w-[19ch] text-[clamp(2.375rem,1.5rem+3vw,4rem)] leading-[1.04] font-semibold" style="--enter-delay: 70ms">
				Know what every event should cost before you quote it.
			</h1>
			<p class="anim-enter mt-6 max-w-[60ch] text-lede text-ink-soft" style="--enter-delay: 150ms">
				CostCook carries each supplier price you approve through recipes, menus, and draft
				orders. See expected food cost before you commit, then turn the confirmed event into
				shopping, prep, and packing work.
			</p>
			<div class="anim-enter mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3" style="--enter-delay: 230ms">
				<a
					href={cta.href}
					target={cta.target}
					rel={cta.rel}
					aria-label={cta.ariaLabel}
					class="btn-primary"
				>
					{cta.label}
				</a>
				<a href="#demo" class="btn-quiet">Watch the 1:43 product tour <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
			</div>
			<p class="anim-enter mt-5 text-sm text-ink-soft" style="--enter-delay: 290ms">
				Bring one real menu or order. Nothing to install.
			</p>
		</div>

		<figure class="anim-enter-settle" style="--enter-delay: 260ms">
			<img
				src="/proof/money-mobile.png"
				alt="A confirmed CostCook order quoted at $6.77 per guest and 41 percent food cost, compared with $6.96 per guest and 42.2 percent at current prices."
				width="716"
				height="404"
				fetchpriority="high"
				decoding="async"
				class="h-auto w-full bg-paper shadow-ticket"
			/>
			<figcaption class="mt-4 max-w-md text-sm text-ink-soft">
				<strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Quoted stays quoted.</strong> Current prices keep
				future work up to date.
			</figcaption>
		</figure>
	</div>
</section>
